  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n <p>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/00b0c0823ac4c2b208485cd3a96b702cf6444acd.png\" alt=\"扩展战斗·更深更暗插件标题图片\" width=\"500\">\n </p>\n <p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-deeper-and-darker-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n   <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1156927/description_cb892b5a-2e64-45b9-b4d4-708a821fcd42.png\" alt=\"Modrinth 页面\" width=\"187\" height=\"64\">\n  </a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a7bff26028f093d51d9da01e07e384f91f63ae13.png\" alt=\"Cloth Config API 依赖\">\n  </a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5aec5c41ae6f0aac946a80fe3cf688a7a336fa09_0.webp\" alt=\"Curios 依赖\">\n  </a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/59e9eeade55f309be535f0b860f0219c8863d4b0_0.webp\" alt=\"扩展战斗依赖\">\n  </a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n   <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/20b0e5c597907d2a9a0d9753f1d998f8f4ec8c11_0.webp\" alt=\"更深更暗依赖\">\n  </a>\n </p>\n <div style=\"text-align:left\">\n  <p>\n   &nbsp;\n  </p>\n  <p>一款为 \n   <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    扩展战斗\n   </a> \n   设计的插件模组，添加了与 \n   <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    更深更暗\n   </a> \n   的兼容性及材料支持。此兼容性模组让你能够使用更深更暗中的材料制作扩展战斗风格物品，从而丰富物品列表。\n  </p>\n  <h4>新增支持：</h4>\n  <p>谐振合金：拳刃、箭袋、弓、弩、盾牌及武器</p>\n  <p>监守者：拳刃、箭袋、弓、弩、盾牌及武器</p>\n  <p>多数配方可在 JEI 中查看</p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p>点击横幅获取折扣： \n   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/91cdbb92-a3db-4f62-a182-239fe5589b2a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting 促销\">\n   </a>\n  </p>\n </div>\n</div>",
